    "Warm up every time: 5 easy minutes of cardio, then one light set before the first working set. Stretch 3–5 min after.",
    "Missed a day? Slide, don't skip. Days 1 and 2 are the priority; Day 4 is the first to drop. Three days is a win, two is fine, zero is the only bad week.",
